  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "how-it-is-built",
      "x": -380,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 320,
      "page": "part-0",
      "text": "One engine, 35 chapter datasets.\n\nLine ink is three solid steps: ink_900, slate_500, grain_300. No dash patterns, and no opacity fade — the brief's 0.12 lands under the token file's declared visibility floor, where a hairline breaks up.\n\nArrowheads share the line's path, so a head can never float free of its line.\n\nPart 0 accumulates on a persistent canvas. Part 1 is a conveyor and accumulates nothing. Part 2 is before-and-after only. Part 3 loops three times and stops."
    }
  ],
